# Strict typing

Adopt explicit typing policy in `docs/adr/` or `docs/spec.md` during 04-tech-plan.

## Python (this backend)

- Prefer concrete types, `TypedDict`, and `Mapping[str, object]` over loose dicts.
- Run Ruff with project config in `pyproject.toml`.
- Add `basedpyright` when the project adopts it (record ADR).

## Before claiming done (backend)

```bash
uv run ruff check src tests
uv run ruff format --check src tests
```

## TypeScript (monorepo frontend)

When PR touches `frontend/`: run `npm run lint` in that package per CI.

See also `ci-after-push.mdc` for full CI parity.
